    "summary": "Falco (born Johann \"Hans\" H\u00f6lzel; 19 February 1957 \u2013 6 February 1998) was an Austrian singer and songwriter. He first achieved European success with Der Kommissar (1981/82) and gained worldwide fame when Rock Me Amadeus topped the U.S. Billboard Hot 100 in 1986, the first and only German-language song to do so. His work blended pop, rock, and rap elements and produced further hits such as Vienna Calling, Jeanny, and Titanic.",
